codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:7:  toolset in b2 build.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:13:refactoring of many toolsets, thanks to Nikita.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:17:* Fix: Inherit generator overrides from a base toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:28:* Fix toolset sub-feature requirements inheritance.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:30:* Unify compile and link of clang-linux toolset with gcc toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:32:* Fix same directory pch header generation for msvc toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:44:* Fix same toolset overrides (inherit-overrides).
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:71:* Fix msvc auto config version priority. Now msvc toolsets are configured in
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:80:* Fix version check for winsdk on `clang-win` toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:159:  and `clang` toolsets.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:161:* Fix not being able to do cross-compiles on macOS with `clang` toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:164:  into a static archive for `gcc` and `clang` toolsets.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:168:* Fix missing assembly flags for intel-win toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:170:* Fix possible command line length limit exceeded error with msvc toolset for
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:225:* Fix errors configuring intel-linux toolset if icpx is not in the PATH but
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:228:* Add `cxxstd=20` to msvc toolset now that VS 2019 onward supports it.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:233:* Fix regression for linking with `clang-win` toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:239:auto-detection and bootstrap for VS 2022 preview toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:241:* *New:* Add vc143, aka VS2022, aka cl.exe 17.x toolset support. Includes
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:242:  building engine and automatic detection of the prerelease toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:248:* Fix use of `JAMSHELL` in gcc toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:264:* Add arm/arm64 target support in clang-win toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:270:* Move Objective-C support to GCC toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:283:* Fix version detection of clang toolset from compiler exec.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:288:This release wraps up a few new features that make using some toolsets easier
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:295:* *New:* Allow clang toolset to be auto-configured to a specific version by using
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:296:  `toolset=clang-xx` on the command line.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:298:* *New:* Include pch header automatically and on-demand on gcc and msvc toolset to
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:314:* Default to using clang on MacOS.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:319:* Add default value for cxx and cxxflags from env vars `CXX` and `CXXFLAGS`
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:320:  when using the custom `cxx` toolset to build the engine.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:322:* Fix detection of `intel-linux` toolset installation when only the compiler
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:339:* Handle spaces in CXX path in `config_toolset.bat`.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:363:support for some toolsets. This means that under most circumstances, if
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:364:supported by the toolset, response files are not generated. Instead the
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:368:  toolset action.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:377:* *New:* Add support for Intel oneAPI release to intel-linux toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:379:* *New:* Add support for Intel oneAPI release to intel-windows toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:391:* Update "borland" toolset to bcc32c for building B2.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:393:* Ensure Embarcadero toolset name is only "embtc".
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:448:* Fix compiler version check on macOS darwin toolset.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:484:* Allow self-testing of toolsets that use response files.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:523:for some toolsets. But most importantly there's new documentation for all
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:533:* Add QNX threading flags for GCC toolset. -- _Aurelien Chartier_
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:539:* Many fixes to intel-win toolset. -- _Edwad Diener_
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:540:* Add z15 instruction set for gcc based toolsets. -- _Neale Ferguson_
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:542:* Add LTO feature and corresponding support for gcc and clang toolsets.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:547:  and sun toolsets. -- _Dmitry Arkhipov_
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:550:* Add armasm (32 and 64) support for msvc toolset. -- _Michał Janiszewski_
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:551:* Fix errors with custom un-versioned gcc toolset specifications.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:553:* Allow arflags override in gcc toolset specifications. -- _hyc_
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:556:* Updated intel-win toolset to support for Intel C++ 19.1.
codes/R104/boost/tools/build/doc/src/history.adoc:563:This patch release fixes a minor issue when trying to configure toolsets that
